What do you want from your pet? In the early game I want a
curse detector, a shop lifter and a helper with some fights.
I don't want some shopkeepers killed. The price ID from a
general store is invaluable.

For those purposes a large cat or large dog is about as good
as it gets.

Later, I will want my pet to kill some selected shopkeepers
and priests for me. By then I should have a key and a leash
or magic whistle so I can control my pet. A level 10 pet
might do the trick but a level 12 is probably safer.

So, no, unless I wanted to do the protection racket or play
pacifist altogether, I wouldn't polymorph my pet that early
in the game.

